      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JILLIBY ILLUMINATE NZ (10) brings strong form from the city where she missed narrowly as runner-up last time and scored a win last month, both times when coming from wide barriers. Starts on the back row but she is good enough to overcome that. HAPPY TOO YA (1) takes a step up in grade but is going well with two wins and a second from the last three outings. Led in each of those so he has the speed to take advantage of the ace draw and his record at this venue stands at five from eight. LOCHINVAR JAG (2) worked and faded last start at Menangle but had recorded a string of wins and placings prior. Draws well and won the last two times he raced here. THE METAL FLYER (9) may need some luck from this barrier but has been producing some decent efforts at Menangle including a second from a wide barrier three back.",
